WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.749 --> 00:00:02.469
- Hey, guys. I'm Corey.

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:04.316
I am going a month without drinking

00:00:04.316 --> 00:00:05.927
