00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:11.803
I like to drink.

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:12.636
I think it's fun.

00:00:12.636 --> 00:00:14.103
It's something that my friends do.

00:00:14.103 --> 00:00:15.117
We go out and we grab some beers

00:00:15.117 --> 00:00:17.468
and it's just how we
engage with each other.

00:00:17.468 --> 00:00:19.726
