00:00:32.561 --> 00:00:34.620
and I need to just take a little break.

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.901
(sighs) Here we go!

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:40.165
(upbeat music)

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.272
